        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas, production mix, at storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas, production mix, at storage
The dataset refers to the mix of biogas fed into natural gas network or sold in pumping stations in the year 2010.  In 2010, 13 operators purified their biogas to biomethane.;
UUID: d37144cf-970c-302f-b79f-4bfa52e3599a
This dataset represents the production mix of biogas fed into the natural gas network. The biogas is generated from digestion of sewage sludge, biowaste, and from agricultural co-fermentation.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Technology mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 193'500 MWh/a
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d37144cf-970c-302f-b79f-4bfa52e3599a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
